cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the Journal of Chemical Physics
  paper it accompanies.
title: mqc-specfunc
abstract: >-
  Mixed quantum-classical propagation of polaron correlation functions
  for the one-dimensional Holstein model, using mean-field Ehrenfest
  and the mapping approach to surface hopping, and for a LiF hole-polaron
  model using k-space mean-field Ehrenfest.
